{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ed5c4461eaa43a89df1c9548a8b0f72b36d99e7fff0a4e0ab55386f7fb5e4d54",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41fdc60812fabafb8190b0754a2b579505c64e2a96144a02375f77fb814c0ba",
      "text": "闪耀的小小原石们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c0e9e73145bbd4a9d26d6cfef49ef52d31e324a8f05e7af79e66aa5b24e5fd",
      "text": "出演少儿特别节目的孩子们。\n对于聚光灯只打在天才童星直央和\n模特花音身上感到不满的志狼，\n但却有人在他们身上看到了巨大可能性的萌芽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41fdc60812fabafb8190b0754a2b579505c64e2a96144a02375f77fb814c0ba",
      "text": "闪耀的小小原石们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a039cf06af4506e409359278a1ece6eb2726a3af5efbce5b04b52c3993a68f6",
      "text": "“喂喂来信”环节，最后一封是……\n“请告诉大家你们擅长的科目”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5219486de4897e7026494bc37709b0187dfd41f0f996ea9d272ae75abadca02",
      "text": "我大概是语文吧。很喜欢读故事。\n花音君呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39364918479047d79e2fa992d9023e676904b9440fe23740db55d831364b8e84",
      "text": "嗯～花音大概是音乐吧。\n从小就一直在学钢琴哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0646ceedc14bd2105e7c604d542ca1dcae5dbb91977728104a648b88ed787c5",
      "text": "我是体育！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e82c3376f67f52cb0489dd5af121df45e20707b61b25f08546d4558d32b5fd0",
      "text": "前阵子打篮球，\n我还投进了灌篮呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7bf2954fa59a433560529456c43ad8e7b76cea5fd679f46bef54e363e2b7b5",
      "text": "那么，和擅长音乐的花音君\n以及运动神经超群的志狼君一起进入下一个环节！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0e1408e7652a9485de928944c50a687bbffd21cea3cdd9c9c24c3257e35b5f",
      "text": "“Let's 唱歌跳舞吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40d0462bbc7cbf0db0b4e113754e7fe1162dfe097a8bb251a5dc25dbbe5e5282",
      "text": "大家也学着我们的样子一起试一试吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858560f8832647d81f65a600ded95dd0a3f15b268ce20336b8a32447c2a781a7",
      "text": "和花音一起，可爱地唱歌吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c2f46c10ccbdfe9055ccb63b0ccf80ec3f822953561fadd73a515108b1a199",
      "text": "别忘了跳舞哦！\n合着歌曲，好好把身体动起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:158a8ff1f2810b1abfb732681caab969be334f62ff38bcfe75f08de7e597ef2c",
      "text": "那么，要开始咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33183cb1f4d364fec715d14b8c78dd5b4331d08e5af8fa897521259dfb04705e",
      "text": "辛苦啦——大家表现得都很完美呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb74a934c9ef2e3524d7b17d1c5ccb09dd04b1caf38661ac9d26ae1700fcc264",
      "text": "直央君的主持，简直无懈可击哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d63b5ac29a10becda26463a8decfe9191543d601a219425ad426b7b7cb6c6462",
      "text": "啊，谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2053df113de0fa6931eabc337a7275dbea6bc76068e02b3d4b0ec11478ab1a8e",
      "text": "呐呐，花音呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e1a55b181c6908c00c54f86cfcdea7a13f76f5eef9a4f13367bb61144673f39",
      "text": "当然，花音君的歌也超级可爱哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c6b9d891cc7f0209302b276546ab8ecb4284398119d9a245ba07b750c17d17",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，谢谢～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc2d74bec4acf3489ff0d27c9e0be105b3fc55d0e3fcade2c23bd8f78815a722",
      "text": "如果这次反响好的话，\n下次还会办特别节目的，到时候也要多多关照哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f2362c0ac3d821efdaa012da8a0c922fa1acf0909f92ab102ff4fb5ccad204",
      "text": "我们才要请您多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89ece661d42e1b8081d63f1cc937e9fc5bb35665ac7ede7a843b3e04a4bfb7d7",
      "text": "花音下次想和布偶装在一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8eda7b1a31efbb3aebe2e44fc6bd0344747fe5d54c31bb58187928a29c29eb9",
      "text": "哈哈，我会考虑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15e20dbb68cf8e12b97bc2a6b7ca520e3b638ae3af20ee69bc234dac2de72d5",
      "text": "……切。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99b41b0788b4bf5dd869b62082999fa29acb6b80ed727ae120724520b3735649",
      "text": "一个个的，全都没眼光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43934ea5579d7e78d3aa9fb2c2d35d4b1b8508cf51e1e9823cabb651c243983a",
      "text": "（今天的舞跳得最好的明明绝对是我。\n大家却只知道直央和花音）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91e935dd0f0375a8f205671d739961adcadda6f7457011ef2189a914a0c66943",
      "text": "（特别是直央……明明跳得比我还烂，\n凭什么那家伙被捧上天啊？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d70bffc9a8c2aeeaf23ad83fa2f1b195ba6e7e979684065bf5e8542f9a128736",
      "text": "可恶～～！\n今天一定要去给那家伙当头一棒……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922ff48f76174b0b3521a898cdec1f7d4c0e2626d17fb405e37d1d28a1e41a0d",
      "text": "志狼哥哥，你在干嘛呀？\n快点换好衣服，来聊游戏的事嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0eabf15ac99cc8657ccf0e79041a1e38270acec04611d95a298df39847d9ae",
      "text": "瞧，快点快点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2ac877d4a6101d50d32264d29d0dc43b241b5975f7c5b2709cefc9b448ffc35",
      "text": "等、别推我啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac995de5ed111071cae8533c4984aeb4818047ce7a099f76f2e6cdff001fea26",
      "text": "真是的……真拿你们没办法～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe3c9f564fd777c9393a736c7d72f875bded0169f3d0d0ba2d0b0ebc56956ac",
      "text": "（今天就先放过你这家伙一马！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c524708c71561cb5eabd3ffdbf61bb2db1f2aa36b563a85df3bb4358d8d45cb",
      "text": "花音差不多该去下一份工作了。\n接下来呢，要去给爸爸做的小衣服当模特哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b296901801748ce0e0ebf3e8295e999c71ac5a090c07eb48d883b4725af18256",
      "text": "那就再见啦♪\n大家辛苦了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bf305ae59982385dc8f58b39c43484be94c8f45f86b96e6ddf13b824a8a310e",
      "text": "直央，我们也差不多该回家了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:307741ebae3480025385e160b052d3051dfccf6adfca234e831d8d98a3f71fff",
      "text": "啊，妈妈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20629803a0a060a33e84e055ee7255e8766eef099fefc9bb2c8134e2d2f82343",
      "text": "直央的主持，非常沉着稳重呢！\n妈妈都吓了一跳！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dad6d06947acb5991edcfdc8b52a22d30b34b315f86b8cbf246c343a3d814b84",
      "text": "是、是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f77df1a21da144987a5f747b08d204760df7decc46827b92b21226710b0f7be3",
      "text": "直央居然能说得那么好。\n果然接下这份工作是对的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b2b1c9be1081106292e5f73ebb5e1f0264e51026a0f7c9b8c1ebbf961597dd",
      "text": "（虽然确实是照着台词本念出来了，\n但这真的算得上能说得好吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd465434f133df9b47d90bcaed2d34f7a51c979d469aa1038b17c314bec2e536",
      "text": "那个，妈妈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069337cd8e496abbccefb30dc148bb6a65445ca231f2fcfa3212fe4deb8ffecc",
      "text": "这份工作，真的适合我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af1ee97d6c6021dfcbe24c912a9cae798e845bad5f50967e4aada70a794d7ab",
      "text": "说什么呢，今天不是也很完美吗。\n直央，有什么担心的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c0b5ffdf10ad7a77840b919d096d54ccd7d892a99ae85918bc86717bcd458e3",
      "text": "没、没有，没什么！\n那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f964bdc208fb90426f9ceaf982d183f04ad08ca12deca53966c958bbbf7deef",
      "text": "（……今天太紧张了，语速一直很快）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:211f623953c2ff8e374ce4e06008b7209a0ae7a733b04f32ce07efc0be08b2d0",
      "text": "（唱歌也没能好好和声，\n跳舞跟志狼君比起来也还差得远……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84e5a6c4fc5eda67e55b57ef38d578ce0dc5b11240b76d4f9fa7d9582119badc",
      "text": "对了，明天之后的行程安排是这样的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23163a95a05983d0164516e4345678b7641472880da2c4fe3d680f0d1d4d26b1",
      "text": "（我果然不管是童星的工作，\n还是上电视的工作，都不适合啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23573bd0cb93d794a3cf4578539321676fa97320109ac3c289d507a669b4d216",
      "text": "妈妈，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "text": "……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad50a5625f9f03223767d9d9c6be3ad7197610342e12f95498b982c4886721c7",
      "text": "直央？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b3941c9a3d6136bb079e55a2a46b9a2d7b45587d39158853029388dd642ae0",
      "text": "（刚才，好像感觉到有什么视线……是错觉吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b20c103ff6a1e966eb947a5b23333457ea7e6705008131d46d5b48de0d10bba",
      "text": "没，没什么。\n我们回家吧，妈妈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db495d5d878e4eccdea8236a7eb6c12ecf9c50acd5416cc11ce15912f92ef79",
      "text": "冈村直央、姬野花音、橘志狼吗……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0e1408e7652a9485de928944c50a687bbffd21cea3cdd9c9c24c3257e35b5f",
      "text": "“Let's 唱歌跳舞吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a1963aa22e6dacd129cd831143a18abdade686ffecf175f5ce0ee76888fe6d4",
      "text": "这就是前阵子去见习录制的\n少儿特别节目吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5109d1ced29645ca69f7d981917ad8cbae33d16c44d0c51737f136b7f44e34",
      "text": "制作人，\n有眼前一亮的孩子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02791dd9f073f53007c941444ad0f054584b5e16b30d09373501376f15259815",
      "text": "有的！\n首先是天才童星冈村直央君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e279ae0e9e8d2a48a63369f3e6dc21dc8a9fb5cf2fc017edde624a67421071f1",
      "text": "他在动画电影里担任过主角声优，\n演技和声音都非常出色。然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9437fc6eae85cb5895f920fefe24a347ea2cd1c40f17c91d4367208f94bf871",
      "text": "大家～注意看花音这边♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:586ca5a061584b8fbd2b4777343282e6f1b39a6fade0e77eac3dcd54bce149d9",
      "text": "接下来是一蹦一跳蹦蹦跳！\n和我们一起，一蹦一跳吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217a3097ff7f1cf36a04ba1e6606af11f3fd38b0db522eb4ab2b321ad3f0596f",
      "text": "觉得难的小朋友，来花音这里集合！\n会给你们施展独家魔法哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74466fddc462b5fdd42a53c37ae8e78fd821fe97d235bda4ae5e3167897e4154",
      "text": "哇啊，大家都好棒！\n做得非常好～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495db0f7ed662fa3b77af6688e89314dfaf072b4600d1c46a182d846385ea4a1",
      "text": "还有作为模特十分活跃的姬野花音君。\n他在舞台上也一定能俘获很多人的心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b096867daac9308799b0be5920861de29d2a2504ece82f48a002edb29ec0f178",
      "text": "这么说，是打算找他们两个人聊聊吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6694cea23aef9af677953d8d99517421cd5422172209df269152279820ef78fe",
      "text": "不……其实，还有一个很厉害的孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4727f070e434b2deb9f540a4916d45bcd703f23eddc5c5bee73e76bc839228f",
      "text": "橘志狼君。\n我也打算去找他聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cce818464df1fb7332e292275d73157cb4158fe5b810f10fea3b7ed8148f46",
      "text": "橘志狼君……\n是个什么样的孩子呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8def73ad842b78e079c6b22079d884a091a1e2b757b2cabf2d039b7c214c7afa",
      "text": "呵呵，看了就知道了。\n看，正好要开始了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe05448736e2c7a8b74bbf9680208211ef5f4627dc949240c8b8e1cc3c0e8bde",
      "text": "One・Two！One・Two！\n来，都跟上我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9776140f2989c7cac6a191afef30c251c60796129c9b17dd181ddf961d1a49c5",
      "text": "哇，舞跳得非常利落干脆呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ac078f2ec44c30c7064720ada00e69f1dc73914d83fc9c1b00c9eefc45cea0b",
      "text": "技术上令人瞩目自不必说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9799fbe4665ddc10afd36b7b3473937795100e4d7177822c188a7a7fd5803026",
      "text": "最重要的是，能从他身上感受到喷薄而出的能量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:740f5358a5ac71e80c14723052723950e3f4f68c60f96c576003c2ceaefc360f",
      "text": "这么说，决定是这三个人了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bab21c3beeade1e88eeecc19aa1296a72e5f9df1a313b9991b822a7265a83090",
      "text": "是的！我打算改天去找他们\n谈一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_g:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b18d3840518f653d1525026cd17b7951d38543fde4443df6c76798be0682550",
      "text": "请等着我，未来的偶像们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e266912c84a77b47e2a5e0def7dadd1ad38cc1a7eae191138e92a684e96552",
      "text": "今天的嘉宾是炙手可热的天才童星，\n冈村直央先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bdd8ad8256f55461c52b863bad1b64317e603cf354e954a671b53539eff6c19",
      "text": "观看《早安News》的各位观众，\n大家早上好。我是冈村直央。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:812960cf2c5ef3d05e68cbf689fb7ecd416c73a85445f732e7bb4a24d8cae4f0",
      "text": "担任主演声优的电影\n大获成功，现在心情如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:233ee6caf40fb9459420f9d8ac722e0aad374898254359f4b2a1a5125d387044",
      "text": "那个……\n总觉得，还没有什么真实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59d7c28684e4b3c8e2870a1a54f4d609a9175b6e2586460e7140b333f22516a",
      "text": "收到这份工作邀请的时候，能出演那位导演的\n作品，就感觉像做梦一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24eaf88cb48325586a7c1f6edd2000c78602f9cc710c35839a043dfb3bfe97f2",
      "text": "那压力也相当大吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86fe724fd4f17ae345b3337897e2a8f6f5fb38f5823e9936bff74724f8048089",
      "text": "是的。不过周围的人\n都非常照顾我，总算是坚持下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fab1e5cf0735876c3b88f7d261423ecbfc299f29b9e4c0ece7eb9e65bc05ad4",
      "text": "最近在电视上大受欢迎的直央先生，\n接下来有什么想要尝试的工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b0588f2a2e9831b993eb91c66f78fdfdd5675f76d0143b8b6e958926862267",
      "text": "下一份工作，吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a225f864038b6e2fd02f06d137dcfdc2564f3eba6e557a3847966127f0779e32",
      "text": "直央先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd564f7b1cba2c092c8bb3333988343fe6aae60cc0d700a82f2ec729712a5a68",
      "text": "对、对不起！我是想说，像演戏、唱歌之类的，\n各种各样的事情我都想挑战一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4de1eac7a4ce3e72412fc67dede02675335e5069dd5dcc90008865df7f41e8c",
      "text": "真让人期待直央先生今后的活跃表现呢。\n那么，最后由直央先生给大家带来一个惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:775325f83f193029621db2086b537a346194da887cab49ea4a47e2e1f73f983b",
      "text": "好的。今天只针对收看本条新闻的观众朋友，\n公开一段未公开的影像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f94c07eb2e25e8fd151cefec9ac41afa1398cbcd213b1b1b54c3cd38453482",
      "text": "请大家一定要看到最后哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f1d40476e3d6b2c8611fb7b8ca34f849adcfd14e7255063e7a3c0593c22ce6",
      "text": "好！放VTR～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b",
      "text": "呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad8c5356e413d3e046bb5de411bd99f0bbf61b46a729b8b9bc83f5c3646dfe14",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n表现得很青涩，感觉很棒哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7494c25e8002e9dbf9b81ed0c8328d020faa7c3c54abafd5e369687cc8eef806",
      "text": "（这么说，意思是其实我没怎么说好吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e771ec26125646771ca3417767d5f7e076667821f4bd1d5cd75d3bc4ea2dc70",
      "text": "那我先告辞了。\n今天非常感谢大家……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:791fe6f91f395383ae7b4d6d96d21dd27fd1c59ad3396a09de1a6bbdacb12ed0",
      "text": "天才童星，吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4e0a484183f8ac7167e9d34a32294fed79309561d4b0d364316bc4f5bbb3e9",
      "text": "（虽然妈妈是因为我性格内向，\n才把我送进剧团的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06c90889453fd68262678986e2e200620cc5dd1037a880066521ccd278cd6aca",
      "text": "（但在那么多人面前说话也好、引人注目也好，\n无论做多少次我还是习惯不了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6a052ccd9bde8da0be0d3f4fb260a6149ebc65ffa4f9af298fdd991003acfc",
      "text": "（当上电影主角也只是运气好，\n比我演得好的孩子多得是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3eb88301b0b7b1dd515592d82e16321442445d4f9cc8038ab416b87c6747340",
      "text": "站在人前的工作，果然还是不适合我。\n所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a575378483881f0b1439c68dc299cbb108c7c5198fcc6962381adc9bfb6d8989",
      "text": "（今天我一定要跟妈妈说清楚）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d427b53fa8faa3c0a762a903549799075ff7d42464de68f5736d600f993bb0bf",
      "text": "（跟她说，我想把这份工作辞了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ba274698425787d2750f6d88804db9735e21d44e1e8067121f10c5410bcd5b3",
      "text": "（不能再一直拖下去了……！\n绝对……绝对要说出口！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88041ea222f13fc2a2ead2bee870c1d3699b81c7e734404b186fa7548c8c7c29",
      "text": "……好，去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
